---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About CurrencieConv - Free Online Currency Converter by Anuska Rani"
  description="CurrencieConv is a free online currency converter built by Anuska Rani. Convert USD to EUR, $ to INR, dollar to rupee, euro to dollar and 150+ currencies with accurate real-time exchange rates. No fees, no signup required."
  keywords="about CurrencieConv, currency converter online, free currency converter, Anuska Rani currency converter, best currency converter, accurate currency converter, world currency converter, online money exchange calculator, $ to inr, dollar to rupee"
  currentPath="/about"
>
  <div class="py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="container-app">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
        <h1 class="text-display-lg mb-4">About CurrencieConv — The Best Free Online Currency Converter</h1>
        <p class="text-body-lg text-body">
          A free, fast, and accurate currency converter built by Anuska Rani. Designed with modern web principles and a focus on user experience.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Story -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-display-md mb-6">Our Story</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-body-md text-body">
          <p>
            CurrencieConv was created to solve a simple problem: most currency converters are cluttered, slow, and filled with unnecessary distractions. We wanted to build something better.
          </p>
          <p>
            Founded by Anuska Rani, CurrencieConv combines real-time financial data with a beautiful, minimalist interface inspired by modern design platforms like Vercel. Every feature is intentional, every interaction is smooth, and every rate is accurate.
          </p>
          <p>
            Whether you're planning international travel, managing business finances, or simply curious about exchange rates, CurrencieConv provides the clarity and speed you need—without the noise.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Values -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-display-md mb-6">Our Values</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 mb-4 bg-link-bg-soft rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-link" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-body-md-strong mb-2">Speed</h3>
            <p class="text-body-sm text-mute">
              Instant calculations with real-time rates. No loading, no delays.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 mb-4 bg-cyan-soft rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-cyan-deep" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-body-md-strong mb-2">Accuracy</h3>
            <p class="text-body-sm text-mute">
              Trusted rates from leading financial data providers worldwide.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 mb-4 bg-success/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-success" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-body-md-strong mb-2">Free Forever</h3>
            <p class="text-body-sm text-mute">
              No ads, no paywalls, no hidden fees. Always free to use.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Features -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-display-md mb-6">What Makes Us Different</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="card">
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 text-link mt-1 flex-center">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-body-md-strong">Minimalist Design</h3>
                <p class="text-body-sm text-mute">Clean, focused interface inspired by Vercel's design philosophy. No clutter, no distractions.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 text-link mt-1">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-body-md-strong">Mobile First</h3>
                <p class="text-body-sm text-mute">Optimized for any device. Convert currencies on your phone, tablet, or desktop seamlessly.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 text-link mt-1">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-body-md-strong">SEO Optimized</h3>
                <p class="text-body-sm text-mute">Multi-page architecture with rich content pages for every currency. Better search engine visibility.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 text-link mt-1">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-body-md-strong">Real-time Rates</h3>
                <p class="text-body-sm text-mute">Exchange rates updated every minute from trusted financial data providers worldwide.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Contact -->
      <div class="bg-canvas-soft border border-hairline rounded-lg p-8 max-w-2xl">
        <h2 class="text-display-md mb-4">Get in Touch</h2>
        <p class="text-body-md text-body mb-6">
          Have feedback, suggestions, or want to report an issue? We'd love to hear from you!
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <a href="mailto:hello@currencieconv.com" class="btn-primary">Send Email</a>
          <a href="https://twitter.com" class="btn-secondary">Follow on Twitter</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
